# Opinions

Copy to `~/OPINIONS.md`.
Agents read this when a decision depends on your viewpoint (see `agents/AGENTS.md`).
Keep it short and concrete.

## Engineering
- Preferred stacks and libraries, and what you avoid.
- Trade-off defaults (for example quality over speed, simple over clever).

## Business and proposals
- Pricing, scope, AMC and delivery preferences.
- Deal-breakers.
